# tests/

Integration and unit tests for the Udex server. Tests use the `maybe_once` pattern with `rstest` for shared test fixtures and resource cleanup. Includes test helpers for OAuth2 client registration and JWT token generation.

## Dirs

- `certs/` -- Self-signed TLS certificates and CA for local HTTPS testing
- `jwt/` -- ECDSA P-256 key pairs for JWT signing and verification with good and bad keys

## Files

- `server_integration_tests.rs` -- Integration tests for the server, tonic clients, and gRPC handlers; manages shared Postgres container and JWT key material
- `entry_service_integration_tests.rs` -- Integration tests for entry service using shared Postgres fixtures
- `index_service_integration_tests.rs` -- Integration tests for index service; verifies initialization and describe endpoints
- `logging_init_tests.rs` -- Tests verifying global tracing subscriber installation; isolated binary to avoid interference
- `logging_not_initialised_test.rs` -- Verification that no subscriber is set before init_tracing; sole test in its binary for isolation
- `auth_server.rs` -- Test helper for Hydra OAuth2 client registration and client_credentials token exchange (ST0007/WP-03)
